  "implementation": [
    "Five main-only strict flat archive IPC commands validate a typed canonical UTF-8 tuple and exact operationId/inputSha256 pair; original Copy wire remains separate.",
    "Copy and Archive share the real worker slot and application-exit protection; cancellation and observer completion do not release the worker before actual I/O cleanup.",
    "Finite in-memory detail/payload/seen limits, exact early cancellation and expiry preserve admission closure without evicting active work or adding persistent history.",
    "Streamed ZIP contains conversation.md, selected attachment bytes and a portable manifest; any selected source failure aborts the whole unpublished package.",
    "Handle-anchored parent/source checks, no-replace publication and actual ZIP readback hash/identity checks distinguish published success, definite failure and unknown.",
    "Generated ordinal basenames retain only a fixed safe extension hint; unknown or active formats use .bin, text uses .txt. Declared MIME and filename suffix do not certify the content format."
  ],
  "tests": {
    "finalPass": 37,
    "failed": 0,
    "ownedFormatExit": 0,
    "clippyExit": 0,
    "independentTestsWithin37": 4,
    "sharedMemberCases": 40,
    "coverage": [
      "Strict schema, explicit nulls, canonical Unicode/empty text/array order/safe-integer samples and hash mismatch rejection.",
      "Actual ZIP bytes/members/manifest/hashes, zero selected attachments, changed/replaced/symlink source failure and temporary material cleanup.",
      "Short writes and output cap, exact pair/domain conflicts, 4096 seen capacity and ready expiry.",
      "Real progress barrier cancellation retains worker, exit permit and shared slot until actual completion.",
      "Parent replacement at publication preserves the published old-parent material and reports unknown; competing destination is not overwritten."
    ]
  },
