  "boundaries": [
    "No formal application, actual Agent, installation or Windows runtime was exercised by this backend evidence.",
    "Readback and identity verification describe the observed publication point, not permanent exclusion of external filesystem changes.",
    "The ZIP stores selected loaded content. It does not scan full history, fetch remote resources, resume an Agent session or prove arbitrary ACL/xattr preservation.",
    "Portable metadata omits source root/resolvedPath/version/private input identity; user-provided Markdown may itself contain paths or secrets and is not rewritten as a privacy scrubber.",
    "The fixed extension whitelist is an unverified filename hint, not a malware, file-format or content-trust check.",
    "Source/controlled backend success is a P35 slice; parent browser, integration and eventual safe installed validation are separate evidence."
  ],
